{"id": "REQ-2022", "category": "returns_refunds", "route": "draft", "reasons": [], "article": "returns-policy", "draft": "Hi Yasmin,\n\nThanks for contacting Fernwood Outfitters about your returns and exchanges question.\n\nYou can return or exchange unworn items with their tags attached within 60 days of delivery. Start the return from the Orders page, choose the items, and print the prepaid return label. Exchanges for a different size or color ship as soon as the carrier scans your return package.\n\nIf anything is unclear, reply to this message and we will help.\n\nBest regards,\nFernwood Outfitters Support", "sent": false, "expected_category": "returns_refunds", "expected_route": "draft", "category_correct": true, "route_correct": true, "seconds": 0.0}
{"id": "REQ-2023", "category": "billing", "route": "draft", "reasons": [], "article": "billing-and-invoices", "draft": "Hi Tom,\n\nThanks for contacting Fernwood Outfitters about your billing, charges, and invoices question.\n\nWhen you place an order we authorize the full amount, and the charge settles when the order ships. A pending authorization and a settled charge can both appear for a day or two, which looks like a double charge; the pending one drops off automatically within five business days.\n\nIf anything is unclear, reply to this message and we will help.\n\nBest regards,\nFernwood Outfitters Support", "sent": false, "expected_category": "billing", "expected_route": "draft", "category_correct": true, "route_correct": true, "seconds": 0.0}
{"id": "REQ-2024", "category": "returns_refunds", "route": "draft", "reasons": [], "article": "refund-timelines", "draft": "Hi Aiko,\n\nThanks for contacting Fernwood Outfitters about your refund timelines question.\n\nRefunds are issued to the original payment method within five business days after the return arrives at our warehouse. Your bank may take a further three to ten business days to show the credit on your statement.\n\nIf anything is unclear, reply to this message and we will help.\n\nBest regards,\nFernwood Outfitters Support", "sent": false, "expected_category": "returns_refunds", "expected_route": "human_review", "category_correct": true, "route_correct": false, "seconds": 0.0}
